{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dance of Blades: Master the Rhythm of Carnage</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With just <strong>Light Attack | Heavy Attack | Dash</strong>, unleash over 40 combat combos\u2014carve your path through the chaos. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/extras/Movie11_12.gif?t=1742957690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Skill Mechanic</strong>: Press <strong>Attack</strong> right <strong>before</strong> dashing ends to chain evasion into lethal counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/extras/Movie11_09.gif?t=1742957690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong>: Crush foes with Heavy Attack lunges or shred hordes with rapid Light Attack flurries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/extras/Movie11_21.gif?t=1742957690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deflect Projectiles</strong>: Parry arrows and spells back to enemies with perfectly timed Heavy Attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/extras/Movie04-2_616x258.gif?t=1742957690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision Counters</strong>: Strike during enemy wind-up phases to deal 3x Weakpoint Damage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/extras/Movie11_06.gif?t=1742957690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutal Creativity</strong>: Ambush bosses via environmental shortcuts or exploit their attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/extras/Movie11_16.gif?t=1742957690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize throwable axes and explosive barrels to control the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/extras/Movie11_18.gif?t=1742957690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Purity of Skill</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No gear grind\u2014victory depends solely on your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 difficulty tiers cater to both newcomers and masochists.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enemy Ecosystem</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horde Onslaught</strong>: Carve &quot;blood corridors&quot; through undead swarms in decaying towns and frozen catacombs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stealth &amp; Carnage</strong>: Backstab grunts, cripple elites with ambushes\u2014choose your slaughter style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nightmare Mode</strong>: Increased enemy aggression and rare loot drops for true blade virtuosos. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exploration &amp; Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guided Open-World</strong>: Linear critical path with environmental clues hinting at secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control Freedom</strong>\uff1aFull rebinding for controllers, mice, or retro WASD+JKL keyboard setup. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u274c Not for players seeking gear builds/base-building/cinematic narratives. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;This is an action forge tempered over three years\u2014  <br>Every frame of blade arc tested 100+ times, every boss an exam of pure mechanics.  <br>No mercy. Only steel speaks here.&quot;</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Slaughter Newcomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/40ee137ff19509c86fbb3fbcd74242db58c84a8e.jpg"},{"name":"Mortal's Demise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/40ee137ff19509c86fbb3fbcd74242db58c84a8e.jpg"},{"name":"Overwhelm the Foe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/40ee137ff19509c86fbb3fbcd74242db58c84a8e.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodshed Carnage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/40ee137ff19509c86fbb3fbcd74242db58c84a8e.jpg"},{"name":"Blazing Edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/9cc5f7fa175f759a8a92c400b8f91c6f21ef3ce8.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Vanquisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/9cc5f7fa175f759a8a92c400b8f91c6f21ef3ce8.jpg"},{"name":"Summit of Excellence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/9cc5f7fa175f759a8a92c400b8f91c6f21ef3ce8.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Crafter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/9cc5f7fa175f759a8a92c400b8f91c6f21ef3ce8.jpg"},{"name":"Demise of the Demon God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/dedbcd67230f65bad3308de5638c8256f3ae9212.jpg"},{"name":"Invincible Against Giants","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2340210/dedbcd67230f65bad3308de5638c8256f3ae9212.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2340210?t=1742957690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742957690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it